WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.308
The ogre dropped the bags onto the table.

2
00:00:04.309 --> 00:00:07.078
Gold coins spilled from one bag.

3
00:00:07.079 --> 00:00:11.425
Smiling, the ogre began to count.

4
00:00:11.426 --> 00:00:19.444
"One . . . Two . . . Three . . . "

5
00:00:19.445 --> 00:00:23.480
He made tall stacks of shiny gold coins.

6
00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:26.902
Jack watched the stacks grow taller and taller.

7
00:00:26.903 --> 00:00:30.444
On and on the ogre counted.

8
00:00:30.445 --> 00:00:37.166
"Twenty-six . . . Thirty-one . . . "

9
00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:41.508
At last the ogre began counting more slowly.

10
00:00:41.509 --> 00:00:55.865
"Fifty-two . . . Fifty-eight . . . Sixty-six—

11
00:00:55.866 --> 00:01:07.418
Zzz . . . Zzz . . . Zzz . . . "

12
00:01:07.419 --> 00:01:12.188
The house shook as the ogre snored.

13
00:01:12.189 --> 00:01:14.235
"Now!" Jack thought.

14
00:01:14.236 --> 00:01:19.095
It was time to escape!

15
00:01:19.096 --> 00:01:24.833
He jumped out of the oven.

16
00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:31.344
Jack didn't see the ogre's wife anywhere.

17
00:01:31.345 --> 00:01:42.376
He tiptoed across the floor.

18
00:01:42.377 --> 00:01:45.060
The ogre continued to snore.

19
00:01:45.061 --> 00:01:55.027
Jack stepped silently toward the table.

20
00:01:55.028 --> 00:01:59.583
With one smooth move, Jack grabbed a bag of gold.

21
00:01:59.584 --> 00:02:05.148
Then he dashed outside.

22
00:02:05.149 --> 00:02:07.734
He ran with the bag.

23
00:02:07.735 --> 00:02:12.050
"I hope the ogre doesn't wake up soon," Jack thought.

24
00:02:12.051 --> 00:02:16.083
Every few steps, he looked back.

25
00:02:16.084 --> 00:02:21.710
But he didn't see the ogre.

26
00:02:21.711 --> 00:02:29.767
Soon Jack came to the beanstalk.

27
00:02:29.768 --> 00:02:32.952
He looked down and saw clouds.

28
00:02:32.953 --> 00:02:36.369
"It's a long way down!" he thought.

29
00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:40.198
Jack's heart thumped.

30
00:02:40.199 --> 00:02:46.273
Clutching the bag tightly, he stepped onto the beanstalk.

31
00:02:46.274 --> 00:02:55.010
He began to climb down carefully toward home.

